The "list warranty" or "system foundation warranty" means if something
breaks, the phone support people will work with you to diagnose the 
problem and identify the broken part. Then you ship the broken part
back east and they will either fix it or send you a new part. This 
usually takes about a week turn around time. Considering the cost
savings, this works ok for us. In an emergency, they will also 
federal express a part if you insist. What type of verbal agreement
did you have with the sales office?

(Other vendors send you a working part first and then you send your 
broken part back in the same box which is very convenient and turn 
around is about 48 hours.)

