*We have a need for an xterm-like program that could be used to run
*with programs expecting a Tektronix 4100 to 4200 series terminal.
*The programs run on a VAX under VMS, the terminal emulator should
*run on an X11 based workstation (DECstation, Indigo, Sparcstation ...)
