Digital does sell a Tektronix 4125 emulator that runs in both VMS
and Ultrix environments under DECwindows. You can run the terminal
emulator on the VAX/VMS machine, setting the DISPLAY to your X11 based
workstation, if that workstation is not a DEC machine. You can run
the emulator on a DECstation or VAXstation and `dlogin', `rlogin' or
`set host' as appropriate and as needed.

Contact your local Digital Sales office for pricing. Ask for the
``DECwindows 4125 Emulator''.

