References: <1992Aug4.154910.1@sc9.intel.com> <1992Aug5.132655.10265@ryn.mro4.dec.com> <1992Aug5.212010.6060@usenet.ins.cwru.edu>
Sender: usenet@kpc.com
Organization: Kubota Pacific Computer, Santa Clara Ca.
