but that still requires a VAX/VMS system.

Has anyone tried setting rn/mxrn etc up to try to emmulate VAXNotes.
I've tried trn an quite like the linking together threads, but its still
not quite there. Also how do you cope with local SECURE/sensitive
groups?? 

